 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20the=20battle's=20OPTIONS=20panel=20on=20the=20wire?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20(whether=20it=20is=20up,=20and=20its=20five=20option=20flags?=
 =?UTF-8?q?),=20read=20only?=
